<div class="xgn-icons-2 revolutionise js-tab-panel-section" id="xgn-icons-2">
<div class="amp-content__container">
<h1 class="amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white">Reasons to automate</h1>
<div class="xgn-icons-2__iconlist">
<div class="xgn-icons-2__card">
<img alt="" class="xgn-icons-2__img" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_reasons_to_automate_card_productivity" />
 <span class="xgn-icons-2__caption amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white"><strong>1. Enhanced Productivity</strong></span>
 <span class="amp-body-large amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white">Automation introduces robots that work tirelessly, consistently performing tasks with unmatched speed and precision. By automating processes, businesses can significantly increase productivity and output.</span>
</div>
<div class="xgn-icons-2__card">
<img alt="" class="xgn-icons-2__img" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_reasons_to_automate_card_quality" />
 <span class="xgn-icons-2__caption amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white"><strong>2. Improved Quality Control</strong></span>
 <span class="amp-body-large amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white">Human error is an inherent risk in manual processes. However, robots offer exceptional accuracy, reducing the chance of errors and inconsistencies.</span>
</div>
<div class="xgn-icons-2__card">
<img alt="" class="xgn-icons-2__img" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_reasons_to_automate_card_resource" />
 <span class="xgn-icons-2__caption amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white"><strong>3. Optimal Resource Utilization</strong></span>
 <span class="amp-body-large amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white">Automation allows for the optimal allocation of resources within a business. By streamlining processes and minimizing wastage, companies can effectively utilize their workforce, materials, and time.</span>
</div>
<div class="xgn-icons-2__card">
<img alt="" class="xgn-icons-2__img" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_reasons_to_automate_card_speed" />
 <span class="xgn-icons-2__caption amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white"><strong>4. Increased Operational Speed</strong></span>
 <span class="amp-body-large amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white">One of the significant advantages of automation is the ability to operate 24/7. Unlike human employees who require breaks and rest, robots can work continuously, accelerating production and reducing turnaround times.</span>
</div>
<div class="xgn-icons-2__card">
<img alt="" class="xgn-icons-2__img" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_reasons_to_automate_card_flexible" />
 <span class="xgn-icons-2__caption amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white"><strong>5. Flexibility and Adaptability</strong></span>
 <span class="amp-body-large amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white">Robots can be programmed and reprogrammed to perform a wide range of tasks, making them highly versatile and adaptable. This flexibility enables businesses to respond quickly to changing market needs and demands.</span>
</div>
<div class="xgn-icons-2__card">
<img alt="" class="xgn-icons-2__img" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_reasons_to_automate_card_savings_gbp" />
 <span class="xgn-icons-2__caption amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white"><strong>6. Cost Savings</strong></span>
 <span class="amp-body-large amp-text-colour amp-text-colour--white">While the initial investment in automation may seem significant, it offers long-term cost savings. By replacing manual labor with robots, businesses can reduce labor expenses, decrease reliance on overtime pay, and minimize the risk of employee-related costs.</span>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
<script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
        document.querySelectorAll('.revolutionise').forEach((section, i) => {
            section.closest('.js-tab-panel-section').style.display = 'none';
        });
        document
            .querySelector('body')
            .addEventListener('click', e => {
                if (e.target.hash === '#revolutionise') {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    document
                        .querySelectorAll('.revolutionise')
                        .forEach((section, i) => {
                            section
                                .closest('.js-tab-panel-section')
                                .style.display = 'block';

                            if (i === 0) {
                                scrollToElement(section, -200)
                            }

                    });

                }
        });
    });
</script>

