    <section class="fs-section" data-section="findSolution" id="findSolution">
<div class="fs-step fs-step--init">

<div class="amp-content__container">
<h2>Find your automation solution</h2>
<div class="fs-items">

<div class="fs-item link" id="cobot">
<img alt="Cobot AX6" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_0725_product_card_level_1_cobots@2x" />
<h3>Collaborative Robots</h3>
<p>Introducing Epson’s first collaborative robot, the Epson AX Series, a masterpiece of high performance engineering.</p>
<a class="fs-btn-link link amp-text-colour--white btn-no-arrow" href="/en_EU/robots/cobot-ax6">Learn more</a>
</div>

<div class="fs-item" id="scara">
<img alt="SCARA" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_1123_product_card_level_1_scara" />
<h3>SCARA Robots</h3>
<p>Epson has a wide variety of industry-leading SCARA robots with their own unique features and capabilities.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link amp-text-colour--white btn-no-arrow" data-target="c1">Select</button>
</div>

<div class="fs-item" id="6-axis">
<img alt="6-Axis" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_1123_product_card_level_1_six-axis" />
<h3>6-Axis Robots</h3>
<p>Epson 6-Axis robots provide flexibility, high performance and reliability.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="c2">Select</button>
</div>

<div class="fs-item" id="options">
<img alt="Options &amp; Accessories" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_0824_product_card_level_1_options_accessories-02" />
<h3>Robot Options and Peripherals</h3>
<p>Increase your robot’s utility with a wide variety of additional options and peripherals, such as vision systems, controllers, parts feeders and more.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="c3">Select</button>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="fs-step fs-step--cat" data-cat="c1">
<div class="amp-content__container">
<h2>SCARA</h2>
<p>Choose a SCARA robot from the available series, from entry level to high-end.</p>
<div class="fs-items">

<div class="fs-item">
<div class="leveltag">Entry level</div>
<img alt="T Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_1123_product_card_level_2_scara_tb_series" />
<h3>T Series</h3>
<p>The T Series virtually eliminates space-constraint issues. With a built-in controller, plus built-in power for end-of-arm tooling, these space-saving all-in-one robots have everything you need, and they install in minutes.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="tSeries">Select</button>
</div>

<div class="fs-item">
<div class="leveltag">Entry level</div>
<img alt="LA Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_0326_product_card_level_2_scara_la_series_01" />
<h3>LA Series</h3>
<p>The LA series robots have been optimised for simple small and mid-sized pick & place applications. They are easy to install, use and maintain, making it a great, affordable entry-level automation solution.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="laSeries">Select</button>
</div>

<div class="fs-item">
<div class="leveltag">ADVANCED LEVEL</div>
<img alt="LS Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_1123_product_card_level_2_scara_lsb_series" />
<h3>LS Series</h3>
<p>The Epson LS Series SCARA robots were created as the low-cost, high-value, high-performance factory solution, and use a wide variety of low-cost technologies.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="lsSeries">Select</button>
</div>

<div class="fs-item">
<div class="fs-ping"><a class="fs-ping-link" href="/robots/safety-functions">Safe<br />motion</a></div>
<div class="leveltag">HIGH END LEVEL</div>
<img alt="GX Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_1123_product_card_level_2_scara_gx_series" />
<h3>GX Series</h3>
<p>A new class of high-power-density SCARA robots, the GX-C builds upon 40 years of expertise to deliver next-level performance and flexibility.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="gxSeries">Select</button>
</div>
</div>

<div class="fs-items fs-items--feat">
<div class="featline">Special kinematic</div>
<div class="fs-item">
<div class="fs-ping"><a class="fs-ping-link" href="/robots/safety-functions">Safe<br />motion</a></div>
<div class="leveltag">High end level</div>
<img alt="RS Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_1225_product_card_level_3_scara_rs_series_rs6@2x" />
<h3>RS Series</h3>
<p>With the ability to cross back under, as well as reach behind themselves, RS-Series robots are able to utilise the entire workspace underneath the arm. As a result, there is no lost space in the centre of the work envelope.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="rsSeries">Select</button>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
<div class="fs-step fs-step--cat" data-cat="c2">
<div class="amp-content__container">
<h2>6-Axis</h2>
<p>Choose a 6-Axis robot from the available series for flexibility, high performance and reliability.</p>
<div class="fs-items" style=" margin: 0 auto;">

<div class="fs-item">
<div class="leveltag">Entry level</div>
<img alt="VT Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_1123_product_card_level_2_6-axis_vt_series" />
<h3>VT Series</h3>
<p>With next-level technology, the VT Series is available at an incredibly low cost with built-in controller and easy-to-use software.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="vtSeries">Select</button>
</div>

<div class="fs-item">
<div class="fs-ping"><div><a class="fs-ping-link" href="/robots/safety-functions">Safe motion</a></div></div>
<div class="leveltag">High end level</div>
<img alt="C Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_0424_fys-c4-series" />
<h3>C Series</h3>
<p>The C Series can help your system reach its full potential. The 6-Axis robots work at high speeds with precise path behaviour, all in an ultra-slim body. The variety of assembly options gives you all the flexibility you need.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="cSeries">Select</button>
</div>

<div class="fs-item">
<div class="fs-ping"><div><a class="fs-ping-link" href="/robots/safety-functions">Safe motion</a></div></div>
<div class="leveltag">High end level</div>
<img alt="CX Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_0326_product_card_level_2_6-axis_cx_series-01" />
<h3>CX Series</h3>
<p>The Epson CX series provides high performance in small places, thanks to its slimline body. It's capable of handling up to 7kg payloads, and the expanded motion range makes it a great choice for complex movements or reaching difficult positions.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="cxSeries">Select</button>
</div>

</div>

<div class="fs-items fs-items--feat">
<div class="featline">Special kinematic</div>
<div class="fs-item">
<div class="leveltag">High end level</div>
<img alt="N Series" src="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/robots_1123_product_card_level_2_6-axis_n_series" />
<h3>N Series</h3>
<p>N-Series 6-Axis robots are a revolutionary new concept for 6-Axis robots. With their new compact "Folding Arm" technology, the innovative robots offer significant advantages in efficiency of motion and workcell space.</p>
<button class="fs-btn-link" data-target="nSeries">Select</button>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
<div class="fs-step fs-step--cat" data-cat="c3">
<div class="amp-content__container" id="accessories"></div>
</div>
<div class="fs-step fs-step--res" id="fsResults">
<div class="amp-content__container">
<h2 id="seriesHeading"></h2>
<p id="seriesDesc"></p>
<div class="fs-items" id="seriesItems"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
