    </div>

    <div class="service__tab-content current tab-1" id="tab-1">
        <div class="flex-tab-container">
            <div class="tab-copy">
                <h2>Technical Support</h2>
                <h3>From choosing the robots to implementation</h3>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Whether you need to find a local service centre for your existing
                    Epson robotics installation, you want to create a whole new setup or
                    integrate Epson robots with your existing implementation, or just find
                    the way to get the most out of your robots and controllers, our
                    highly-trained experts are here to help.</span>
                <h5>Technical support</h5>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Phone: <a href="tel:+4921154229009">+49 (0) 211 5422 9009</a></span>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Email:
                    <a href="mailto:support.ms@epson.de">support.ms@epson.de</a></span>
                <h3>Feasibility studies</h3>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Instead of theoretical simulations, we can also carry out feasability
                    studies with real robots and options. You get the optimal robot
                    configuration, the best possible installation location and accurate
                    results before you invest. This provides you with maximum planning and
                    project security.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-qr">
                <h3 style="text-align: left; margin: 0 0 20px">
                    The faster way to get support
                </h3>
                <a href="https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=X9b6ligtUkGFDxTDWR3H0EluchB7lfhFhYZoliw3llVUOVQxQVhMWFZCN1ZaRlIxRE5PVlNPS1E2Wi4u&amp;wdLOR=cEA20D1EF-417F-4E8D-B40C-A25681E23C8F"><img alt="" class="tech-support-qr" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_service_centre_technical_support_qr_code">
                    <span class="amp-body-large"></span></a><a href="https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=X9b6ligtUkGFDxTDWR3H0EluchB7lfhFhYZoliw3llVUOVQxQVhMWFZCN1ZaRlIxRE5PVlNPS1E2Wi4u&amp;wdLOR=cEA20D1EF-417F-4E8D-B40C-A25681E23C8F">Robotics
                    Service &amp; Support</a>



            </div>
            <div><br></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="service__tab-content tab-2" id="tab-2">
        <div class="flex-tab-container">
            <div class="tab-copy pad-btm-40">
                <h2 class="pad-btm-40">Service</h2>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Hotline service, on-site repair service, inspection and individual
                    maintenance concepts, as well as spare part packs tailored to your
                    individual requirements are only a few examples demonstrating that we
                    do everything we can to ensure your production operates without
                    interruption.</span>
                <h5>Service</h5>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Phone: <a href="tel:+4921154229009">+49 (0) 211 5422 9009</a></span>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Email:
                    <a href="mailto:service.ms@epson.de">service.ms@epson.de</a></span>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-qr">
                <h3 style="text-align: left; margin: 0 0 20px">
                    The faster way to get support
                </h3>
                <a href="https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=X9b6ligtUkGFDxTDWR3H0EluchB7lfhFhYZoliw3llVUOVQxQVhMWFZCN1ZaRlIxRE5PVlNPS1E2Wi4u&amp;wdLOR=cEA20D1EF-417F-4E8D-B40C-A25681E23C8F"><img alt="" class="tech-support-qr" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_service_centre_technical_support_qr_code">
                    <span class="amp-body-large"></span></a><a href="https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=X9b6ligtUkGFDxTDWR3H0EluchB7lfhFhYZoliw3llVUOVQxQVhMWFZCN1ZaRlIxRE5PVlNPS1E2Wi4u&amp;wdLOR=cEA20D1EF-417F-4E8D-B40C-A25681E23C8F">Robotics
                    Service &amp; Support</a>



            </div>
            <div><br></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-cards-container">
            <div class="tab-card service-tab-card">
                <img alt="" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_service_centre_service_icon_hotline">
                <h5>Spare parts service</h5>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Keeping your own spare parts handy can result in high storage costs.
                    We provide you with a spare parts management system which gives you
                    access to all the assemblies and components that you need. All spare
                    parts are delivered within short lead times from our central warehouse
                    in Meerbusch.</span>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Phone: <a href="tel:+4921154229008">+49 (0) 211 5422 9008</a></span>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Email: <a href="mailto:order.ms@epson.de">order.ms@epson.de</a></span>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-card service-tab-card">
                <img alt="" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_service_centre_service_icon_maintenance">
                <h5>Preventive maintenance</h5>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Preventive maintenance increases the service life of your system and
                    minimises the risk of downtime. We’re happy to assist you with the
                    creation of an effective maintenance plan.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-card service-tab-card">
                <img alt="" src="https://i8.amplience.net/i/epsonemear/robots_1123_service_centre_service_icon_repair">
                <h5>Hotline and repair service</h5>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Our robot systems are well-known for their excellent reliability. If
                    a robot should come to a standstll or if critical parts must be
                    exchanged after thousands of operating hours, our engineers will
                    support you by phone or on site.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="service__tab-content tab-3" id="tab-3">
        <div class="flex-tab-container">
            <div class="tab-copy">
                <h2 class="pad-btm-40">Training</h2>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Whether you’re interested in introductory seminars, programming and
                    maintenance courses or operator training, our experts are happy to
                    pass on their knowledge to you and your staff.</span>
                <h3>Become a robotic expert</h3>
                <span class="amp-body-large pad-btm-40">Our training structure is based on answering individual questions
                    rather than running a training factory. In small groups, you’ll both
                    theory and how to practice it on real Epson robots. We’re also happy
                    to offer special corporate training upon request. Contact Us.</span>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Just give us a call on:<br>
                    <a href="tel:+4921154229008">+49 (0) 211 5422 9008</a></span>
                <br>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Or send us an email at:
                    <a href="mailto:academy.ms@epson.de">academy.ms@epson.de</a></span>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://epsonemear.a.bigcontent.io/v1/static/MS Academy Informations 2024_EN" target="_blank">Download brochure</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="service__tab-content tab-4" id="tab-4">
        <div class="flex-tab-container">
            <div class="tab-copy">
                <h2 class="pad-btm-40">Our focus is your solution</h2>
                <h5>
                    Join us as we bring the future of automation closer to you at Epson Experience Center
                </h5>
                <span class="amp-body-large">Explore state-of-the-art automation from the comfort of your own
                    screen. Immerse yourself in our hybrid trade fair, where you can meet
                    the experts and delve into the world of industrial solutions.</span>
                <h5>What to expect:</h5>
                <ul class="what-to-expect">
                    <li class="amp-body-large">
                        <strong>Live demos:</strong> Experience efficient part handling
                        through captivating virtual live demonstrations.
                    </li>
                    <li class="amp-body-large">
                        <strong>Application insights:</strong> Find out how Epson robots
                        improve yields and enhance quality in real-world scenarios,
                        encompassing sensitive force measurement, flexible parts feeding,
                        intelligent high-precision screwdriving, and economical order
                        picking.
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <h5>Secure your virtual spot:</h5>

